		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg2">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=263" title="View the profile of /-|verse Thule">/-|verse Thule</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Splitpaw Gnoll<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Gender: <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/Male.gif" alt="Male" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 57<br />
								<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/YaBBImages/avatars/evildude.jpg" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								&lt;Oggok Foreign Legion&gt;<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=263"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=788.msg7290#msg7290"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=788.msg7290#msg7290">Re:Laterz</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #23 on:</b> April 26, 2004, 12:38:40 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							<div class="quoteheader">Quote from: Eelyen link=board=1;threadid=788;start=15#msg7270 date=1082918899</div><div class="quote">I&#039;ll just add this. &nbsp;Regardless, I&#039;ve been a guild leader in some fashion for about 3 years of my 5 years of Everquest.<br /><br />I&#039;ve made choices and decisions that have impacted alot of people in both positive and negative ways. &nbsp;And I know that some of those choices have changed this servers history.<br /><br />Things could of been alot different if I hadn&#039;t pulled my app from Ascent and not have created Anthology. &nbsp;I could of just lived my game out as a peon wizard. &nbsp; Or I could of quit the game. &nbsp;Who knows.<br /><br />I know that I&#039;ve made a difference in both good and bad ways. &nbsp;I&#039;ve done the best I can. &nbsp;I can&#039;t change the person I am. &nbsp;But I always did do things I could for others and to see success for myself.<br /><br />Now I just want to relax and enjoy the game if I continue to play. &nbsp;I may just go back to raid leading again. &nbsp;But again, I&#039;ve been leading most of my everquest career. &nbsp;I am not sure what I want anymore. &nbsp;But this has given me the opportunity to decide for real and not carry the heavy burden I&#039;ve felt for so long.<br /><br />Thats all <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/smiley1.gif" alt="Smiley" border="0" /><br /></div><br /><br />How many &quot;I&quot; and &quot;my&quot; statments in that post?<br />lol.
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" /><img src="http://members.cox.net/aversethule/aversesig.jpg" alt="" border="0" />
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
