	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg7304"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg2">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=174" title="View the profile of Delheru">Delheru</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Hill Giant<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 104<br />
								<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/YaBBImages/avatars/blank.gif" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=174"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=788.msg7304#msg7304"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=788.msg7304#msg7304">Re:Laterz</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #27 on:</b> April 26, 2004, 04:59:07 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							<div class="quoteheader">Quote</div><div class="quote">Gee, when did a goodbye post by Fig become a referendum on Eelyen&#039;s ability to lead a guild? </div><br />When the two had immediate connection via what is known as &quot;cause and effect&quot;?<br /><br /><br /><div class="quoteheader">Quote</div><div class="quote">Whatever they have to work out within their guild (of which I have no clue and don&#039;t profess to), I&#039;m sure can be handled by them within their guild </div><br />You have quite a bit of faith.<br /><br />Anyway I had always wanted to say what I posted. Mostly I kept my mouth shut, because the stream of apps we got from FoTime saying &quot;fuck Eelyen&quot; was so damn nice. They equipped them, they flagged them and we reaped the harvest. This is btw why we have many rather anti-Eelyen people in guild.<br /><br /><br />On top of that I quite genuinely believe that the advice I gave Eelyen was sound, and something he had missed. I have absolutely nothing to gain from whatever happens to him from now on, so actually simple urge to help played a significant role in me posting that.<br /><br />We all have blind spots. It&#039;s nice when someone points them out.
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg7305"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=200" title="View the profile of Eelyen">Eelyen</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								The Overmind<br />
								Hill Giant<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Gender: <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/Male.gif" alt="Male" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 153<br />
								<br />
								<img src="http://www.fotguild.com/images/avatars/eelavatar.jpg" width="65" height="65" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								The Overmind<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=200"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
								<a href="http://www.fotguild.com" title="Fires of Time Guild" target="_blank"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/www_sm.gif" alt="WWW" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=788.msg7305#msg7305"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=788.msg7305#msg7305">Re:Laterz</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #28 on:</b> April 26, 2004, 05:19:30 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Delheru, do you realize that since last August. &nbsp;We&#039;ve only lost 3...maybe 4 people to Ascent?<br /><br />I wouldn&#039;t call that a stream. &nbsp;Thanks :P
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />Sage Eelyen of the Nexus<br />Overmind of Fires of Time<br />Proud Member of the RNRH
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg7311"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg2">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=472" title="View the profile of Kriyn">Kriyn</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Splitpaw Gnoll<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Gender: <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/Male.gif" alt="Male" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 73<br />
								<br />
								<img src="http://www.treefingers.com/gallery/gallery/jonny/jonny54.jpg" width="65" height="65" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								I&#039;m not living, I&#039;m just killing time<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=472"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
								<a href="http://www.magelo.com/eq_view_profile.html?num=635213" title="Magelo - Kriyn Nutzforcatnip" target="_blank"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/www_sm.gif" alt="WWW" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=788.msg7311#msg7311"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=788.msg7311#msg7311">Re:Laterz</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #29 on:</b> April 26, 2004, 10:28:07 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;I should prob start shunning all the members that left FoD for Conviction/RoS/UoP and other guilds. &nbsp;Especially that rotten dwarf Delfino, j/k. &nbsp;Anyway, what&#039;s done is done and those that don&#039;t like Eelyen should be happy enough that he is gone and let him go in peace, but that prob wont happen <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/smiley1.gif" alt="Smiley" border="0" /><br /><br /> &nbsp; &nbsp; I take back what I said about those that left since I the Overlord of FoD am now stepping down from my position as Guild Representitive/Recruiter/Raid Leader/etc.... &nbsp;But Delfino still deserves a glare of mistrust &nbsp;&gt;:( &nbsp; &nbsp;
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />I&#039;m ok, how are you?<br /><img src="http://www.treefingers.com/gallery/gallery/radiohead/radiohead13.jpg" alt="" border="0" /><br /><a href="http://www.magelo.com/eq_view_profile.html?num=635213" target="_blank">Kriyn Nutzforcatnip</a><br />70 Prophet of Radiohead<br />Reign of Swords
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
</table>
